 "details": "\"Wormser Weihnacht\", the Christmas market in the heart of Worms, the city of the Nibelungen and of the Romanesque cathedral St. Peter, with a stage programme.\n\nFrom 20 November to 23 December 2026, closed on Totensonntag (22 November). Around it the city runs \"Worms im Advent\": Advent concerts in the churches, Turmblasen on 20 December, markets in the districts. Entry is free; daily opening hours are not published yet.",
